=2 Walkthrough
* Examine the {p:Animal Spoor} in {z:Xarcabard (S)} at (J-9).
** Close to the {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} zone.
* Examine the {p:Wheel Rut} at (I-9), early in the dead-end tunnel at the southern part of the grid.
* Examine the {p:Animal Spoor} at (J-9) again for a {@k} {k:Vial of military prism powder}.
* Examine the {p:Forbidding Portal} door in the northwest corner of (I-7) for a cutscene. Examine it again to enter the Battlefield.

In this BC you must fight 2 {m:Bloodwing Deathrainers|Bloodwing Deathrainer} ({p:BLM}), 4 {m:Bloodwing Maimers|Bloodwing Maimer} ({p:WAR}), a {p:Bugard|Category:Bugard} named {m:Gherrmoga}, and {m:Kingslayer Doggvdegg|Kingslayer Doggvdegg (S)} ({p:PLD}).
* You will be assisted by {p:Excenmille|Excenmille (S)}; should he fall, the battle will instantly end in failure. Do not delay too long at the beginning, or he might run in and get himself killed.
* Defeating {m:Kingslayer Doggvdegg|Kingslayer Doggvdegg (S)} will end the fight regardless of the other NMs' health; however, his death may be prolonged due to {p:Invincible}.
** If you lose the battlefield, wait until the next Vana'diel day and return to the **Animal Spoor** to receive another {@k} {k:Vial of military prism powder}.

After the fight, examine the {p:Wheel Rut} back at (I-9) for a cutscene that ends the quest and your reward. If you are working on missions then return to {M:Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze|Fate in Haze}.
